#: main.cpp:24 mainwindow.cpp:12
msgid "NVIDIA Driver Manager"
msgstr "NVIDIA 驱动管理器"

#: main.cpp:26
msgid "Manage NVIDIA drivers on Fedora Linux"
msgstr "管理 Fedora Linux 上的 NVIDIA 驱动"

#: main.cpp:28
msgid "(C) 2027 KairikiFedora"
msgstr "(c) 2027 KairikiFedora"

#: mainwindow.cpp:20
msgid "Detecting GPU..."
msgstr "正在检测显卡……"

#: mainwindow.cpp:24
msgid "Current driver: detecting..."
msgstr "当前驱动：检测中……"

#: mainwindow.cpp:28
msgid "Select Driver Version"
msgstr "选择驱动版本"

#: mainwindow.cpp:38
msgid "Configure MOK for Secure Boot (if enabled)"
msgstr "配置安全启动的 MOK（如果启用）"

#: mainwindow.cpp:42
msgid "Install / Switch Driver"
msgstr "安装/切换驱动"

#: mainwindow.cpp:58
msgid "NVIDIA GPU detected ✓"
msgstr "检测到 NVIDIA 显卡 ✓"

#: mainwindow.cpp:63
msgid "This computer does not need additional drivers."
msgstr "此计算机不需要额外的驱动。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:71
msgid "Current driver: not installed"
msgstr "当前驱动：未安装"

#: mainwindow.cpp:73
msgid "Current driver: %1"
msgstr "当前驱动：%1"

#: mainwindow.cpp:99
msgid "Secure Boot Ignored"
msgstr "忽略安全启动"

#: mainwindow.cpp:100
msgid ""
"Secure Boot is enabled, but you chose not to configure MOK.\n"
"The driver may fail to load after installation."
msgstr ""
"安全启动已启用，但您选择不配置 MOK。\n"
"驱动程序在安装后可能无法加载。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:116
msgid "Confirm Installation"
msgstr "确认安装"

#: mainwindow.cpp:117
msgid ""
"The system will install/switch to the following packages:\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"This requires root privileges and may download packages. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"系统将安装/切换到以下软件包：\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"这需要 root 权限，可能会下载软件包。是否继续？"

#: mainwindow.cpp:126
msgid "Authentication Required"
msgstr "需要身份验证"

#: mainwindow.cpp:127
msgid ""
"Administrator privileges are required to install drivers.\n"
"Operation cancelled."
msgstr ""
"安装驱动程序需要管理员权限。\n"
"操作已取消。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:134
msgid "Success"
msgstr "成功"

#: mainwindow.cpp:135
msgid ""
"Driver installed successfully.\n"
"Please reboot to apply changes."
msgstr ""
"驱动程序安装成功。\n"
"请重启以应用更改。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:138
msgid "Error"
msgstr "错误"

#: mainwindow.cpp:139
msgid ""
"Driver installation failed.\n"
"Check terminal output for details."
msgstr ""
"驱动程序安装失败。\n"
"请检查终端输出以获取详情。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:152
msgid "Secure Boot Detected"
msgstr "检测到安全启动"

#: mainwindow.cpp:153
msgid ""
"Secure Boot is enabled on this system.\n"
"NVIDIA drivers must be signed to load.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to configure Machine Owner Key (MOK) now?"
msgstr ""
"此系统上启用了安全启动。\n"
"NVIDIA 驱动程序必须签名才能加载。\n"
"\n"
"是否现在配置机器所有者密钥 (MOK)？"

#: mainwindow.cpp:157
msgid "Configure MOK"
msgstr "配置 MOK"

#: mainwindow.cpp:158
msgid "Skip (Install anyway)"
msgstr "跳过（仍然安装）"

#: mainwindow.cpp:168
msgid "MOK Configuration Failed"
msgstr "MOK 配置失败"

#: mainwindow.cpp:169
msgid ""
"Failed to set up MOK. You can still install the driver, but it may not load "
"with Secure Boot enabled."
msgstr ""
"设置 MOK 失败。您仍然可以安装驱动程序，但在启用安全启动的情况下可能无法加载。"

#: mainwindow.cpp:174
msgid "MOK Configured"
msgstr "MOK 已配置"

#: mainwindow.cpp:175
msgid ""
"The Machine Owner Key has been imported successfully.\n"
"\n"
"When you reboot, the MOK management interface will appear.\n"
"Select 'Enroll MOK' -> 'Continue' -> 'Yes' and enter the password:\n"
"    nvidia-mok\n"
"\n"
"After enrolling, the driver will load correctly."
msgstr ""
"机器所有者密钥已成功导入。\n"
"\n"
"重启时，将出现 MOK 管理界面。\n"
"选择“Enroll MOK” -> “Continue” -> “Yes”，然后输入密码：\n"
"    nvidia-mok\n"
"\n"
"注册后，驱动程序将正确加载。"
